&lt;td&gt;&lt;a class="link" href="https://linsk27.github.io/projects/ai-vue-flask-blog/" &gt;文章&lt;/a&gt; · &lt;a class="link" href="https://github.com/linsk27/AI-Vue3-python-flask-Blog" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
